# demo_rect_live Specification

## Overview

`demo_rect_live` demonstrates live rectangle detection and tracking with enhanced visualization.

## Usage

```bash
python demo_rect_live.py [options]
```

## Arguments

| Argument | Type | Default | Description |
|----------|------|---------|-------------|
| `--device` | int | 0 | Camera device index |

## Features

- Live rectangle detection
- Enhanced tracking visualization
- Real-time processing

## Exit

- Press ESC to quit
